   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:9952a",
   "off": 628010,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「あんたら困っていること\r  があるなら リオに相談\u0010\b  してみな\u0010\b  あいつなら いろいろ裏の\r  事情にも通じているから」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Got troubles, you two?\u0010\bTry talking to Rio.\u0010\bHe knows all about what goes on behind the scenes.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:995a3",
   "off": 628131,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "通行人Ｂ\r",
   "en": "Passerby B\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:995b6",
   "off": 628150,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「なにかあったら\r  お嬢さんの持っている\u0010\b  瞳の紋章をみせればいい」\u0010",
   "en": "\"If anything happens, just show them\u0010\bthe Iris Crest the young lady carries.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:995ff",
   "off": 628223,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「リオなら酒場に\r  いるんじゃないかな」\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Rio? He's probably at the tavern.\"\u0010\b",
