   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:99641",
   "off": 628289,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「反魔導聖堂組織の娘が\r  捕まったそうだ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"I hear a girl from the resistance got caught.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:99670",
   "off": 628336,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「キラル様は５０年ぶりの\r  王国の娘です\u0010\b  ここ１年ほどは大聖堂に\r  こもって 姿をお見せに\r  なりませんが…」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Kiral-sama is the first Daughter of the Kingdom in fifty years.\u0010\bBut this past year or so, she has stayed shut away in the Cathedral and not shown herself...\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:996e3",
   "off": 628451,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "兵士風の男\r",
   "en": "Soldierly Man\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:996f8",
   "off": 628472,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「そのお嬢さんは\r  知識聖堂の司祭かい？\u0010\b  何故､こんな所に…」\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Is the young lady a priestess of the Temple of Knowledge?\u0010\bWhat's she doing in a place like this...\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:9973d",
   "off": 628541,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「おれは 新しい目を入れて\r  もらったのさ\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"I had a new eye put in.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:99769",
   "off": 628585,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  ずいぶん高くついたがね\r  この国の医療聖堂とやらの\r  力は 本物だぜ」\u0010",
   "en": "Cost me a pretty penny, though. This country's Temple of Medicine lives up to its name, I'll tell ya.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:997b5",
   "off": 628661,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "乞食\r",
   "en": "Beggar\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:997bc",
   "off": 628668,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「おめぐみを …」\u0010\r",
   "en": "\"Spare a coin...?\"\u0010\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:997d1",
   "off": 628689,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  ５Ｇをあたえますか？",
   "en": "Give him 5G?",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:997f2",
   "off": 628722,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「それは残念なことじゃ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Ah, that's a shame, that is.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:9981f",
   "off": 628767,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「何と！わしのような乞食に\r  与える金もないとは！\r  かわいそうにのう…\u0010\b  …\u0010  …\u0010  …\u0010  …\u0010  …\u0010\b  これは わしからの\r  プレゼントじゃ\u0010\r  大事に持っているがよい」\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"What! You've not even got a coin for an old beggar like me? You poor soul...\u0010\b...\u0010 ...\u0010 ...\u0010 ...\u0010 ...\u0010\bHere's a little present from me.\u0010 Keep it safe, eh.\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:998dc",
   "off": 628956,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「何と わしのような乞食に\r  与える金もないとは！\r  かわいそうにのう…\u0010\b  わしが与えたアイテムも\r  持っていないようじゃし\r  やれやれじゃのう」\u0010",
   "en": "\"What! You've not even got a coin for an old beggar like me? You poor soul...\u0010\bAnd it seems you don't even have the item I gave you. Dear, oh dear.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:9996e",
   "off": 629102,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「何と わしのような乞食に\r  与える金もないとは！\r  かわいそうにのう…\u0010\b  じゃが もう おぬしには\r  何もやれんぞ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"What! You've not even got a coin for an old beggar like me? You poor soul...\u0010\bBut I've nothin' more to give ya, I'm afraid.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:999f1",
   "off": 629233,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「へへ… ありがとう\r  ございやす\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Heh heh... Much obliged, guv.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:99a15",
   "off": 629269,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  ところで だんな\r  おととい 北の空に妙な\r  雲が見えましたが\u0010\b  ありゃ なんですかねぇ」\u0010",
   "en": "By the way, guv... The day before yesterday, there was a strange cloud in the northern sky.\u0010\bWhat d'you reckon that was?\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:99a7f",
   "off": 629375,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「へへ… ありがとう\r  ございやす\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Heh heh... Much obliged, guv.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:99aa3",
   "off": 629411,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  ところで だんな\u0010\r  東地区の丘の上の\r  屋敷に 毎晩怪しい光が\u0010\b  ともるのを知ってやすか」\u0010",
   "en": "By the way, guv...\u0010 D'you know about the strange light that shows every night\u0010\bat the mansion on the hill in the East District?\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:99b0f",
   "off": 629519,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「へへ… ありがとう\r  ございやす\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Heh heh... Much obliged, guv.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:99b33",
   "off": 629555,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  大きな声じゃ言えねえん\r  ですがね\u0010\b  前の王様は 殺されたん\r  だっていう話ですぜ…」\u0010",
   "en": "Can't say it too loud, mind...\u0010\bbut word is the old King was murdered...\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:99b9b",
   "off": 629659,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「へへ… 毎度ありがとう\r  ございやす\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Heh heh... Much obliged, as always.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES02:99bc3",
   "off": 629699,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  ですが だんな\u0017 もう\r  あっしが知っている\r  情報は ありませんぜ」\u0010",
